From 53775fefa37634f23adb7f1f127ca5c7f50f3264 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 15:20:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XD Netplay: shorter launcher and editor notes, no portrait
 explainer, wrapped notes never clip, link progress logged not shown (v1.5.9)

- Battle Style and Team Editor notes cut to one and two lines on community
  feedback; the '(no portrait)' explainer removed everywhere (the per-model
  suffix is the explanation). Detail moved into tooltips.
- MakeNoteLabel: word-wrapped notes use QSizePolicy::Minimum/Minimum (the
  upstream ConvertDialog/AchievementBox pattern) so a dialog shown shorter
  than its preferred height can no longer squash and clip them.
- GBA link progress goes to the gba_detect log (link-progress events) instead
  of the on-screen display, per the field.
